# Example 2

First Letter Capital

```sql
DELIMITER $$

CREATE FUNCTION FirstLetterCapital(str VARCHAR(100))

RETURNS VARCHAR(100)

DETERMINISTIC

BEGIN

RETURN CONCAT(

UPPER(LEFT(str,1)),

LOWER(SUBSTRING(str,2))

);

END $$

DELIMITER ;
```

Execute

```sql
SELECT FirstLetterCapital('ruturaj');
```

Output

```
Ruturaj
```

