# Example 7

Even or Odd

```sql
DELIMITER $$

CREATE FUNCTION EvenOdd(num INT)

RETURNS VARCHAR(20)

DETERMINISTIC

BEGIN

IF num % 2 = 0 THEN

RETURN 'Even';

ELSE

RETURN 'Odd';

END IF;

END $$

DELIMITER ;
```

Execute

```sql
SELECT EvenOdd(25);
```

Output

```
Odd
```

