# Example 10

Factorial

```sql
DELIMITER $$

CREATE FUNCTION Factorial(num INT)

RETURNS BIGINT

DETERMINISTIC

BEGIN

DECLARE i INT DEFAULT 1;

DECLARE result BIGINT DEFAULT 1;

WHILE i<=num DO

SET result=result*i;

SET i=i+1;

END WHILE;

RETURN result;

END $$

DELIMITER ;
```

Execute

```sql
SELECT Factorial(5);
```

Output

```
120
```

